# Citation metadata, read by GitHub ("Cite this repository") and by Zenodo.
# At each release, set version and date-released; add the DOI once archived.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Reconstitution
abstract: >-
  A deterministic browser tool that determines the volume of diluent to add to
  a vial for a target concentration, or the concentration a stated volume
  gives. It requires the user to declare what the stated content is the content
  of, where the figure came from, the conjugate state, carrier presence, the
  volume basis and whole-vial reconstitution, corrects for the volume the dry
  solids occupy, and reports an upper bound where only the reagent's own volume
  can be corrected. No model and no inference is applied to any reported value,
  and no data entered by a user leaves the browser.
authors:
